msgid "使用须知"
msgstr "User Notice"

msgid "使用须知文本"
msgstr "Welcome to Mario Forever: Maker Party!\n\nMario Forever: Maker Party is a game with DIY features. Please ensure the following during gameplay:\n· The levels you create shall comply with public order and good morals, and must not contain inappropriate, illegal or non-compliant content such as violence, pornography, vulgarity, discrimination or horror.\n· Abide by local laws and regulations.\n· Do not use the level creation function to produce or spread malicious code, viruses, or design malicious levels that may induce device malfunctions or information leakage for players.\n\nLevel Storage Notice:\n· For level reuse purposes, the levels you create will be automatically cached to other players' local devices during online gameplay; similarly, levels created by other players will also be automatically cached to your local device.\n\nMessage System Notice:\n· For security reasons, please do not send sensitive information. Communicate respectfully.\n· Messages sent are visible to all players in the current room. Messages may be saved by others."

